# Per-skill security-audit suppressions (auditable). Scoped to this skill only;
# detection is unchanged for every other skill, and each entry is pinned to an
# exact file:line so a NEW finding elsewhere in the same file still surfaces.
#
# .mcp.json (line 0 = file-level finding): reviewed MCP server config — launches
# the skill's own bundled servers via `npx tsx ...` with ${ENV} placeholders;
# no inline shell, no secrets. Kept hidden because MCP clients require this name.
FS-HIDDEN  .mcp.json:0
#
# Local PostToolUse git hook: parses Claude Code stdin JSON via an inline python3
# snippet; inspectable, runs only on the developer's machine, not agent-facing.
CODE-EXEC  hooks/validate-test.sh:10
